flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Frontend renders Overstock-only dashboard]
    B --> C[User selects step and submits form]
    C --> D{Route type}

    D -->|Step 01 upload| E[POST /process/step-01]
    D -->|SQL / summary action| H[POST to step-specific process endpoint]

    E --> J[FastAPI validates request and selected company code]
    H --> J

    J --> K[build_services loads Overstock profile and runtime config]
    K --> L[Repository ensures SQL Server database is available]
    L --> M{Request category}

    M -->|Step 01| N[Save upload to temp storage]
    N --> O[InquiryProcessor reads file into pandas DataFrame]
    O --> P[Normalize SQL-safe column names]
    P --> Q[Apply company aliases and required-column validation]
    Q --> R[Prepare derived columns like Ndatee, pay_day, and Cclaim]
    R --> S[Write STEP_01_NORMALIZED_INQUIRY.xlsx]
    S --> T[Upload normalized rows into step_01_inquiry_rows]
    T --> U[Run SQL script to create CR, IN, and DB split tables]
    U --> V[Log status and append history event]

    M -->|SQL / summary action| AR[Execute step-specific SQL script through repository]
    AR --> AS[Read target table counts or execution messages]
    AS --> AT[Log status and append history event]


    V --> AZ[Render HTML response with success or failure message]
    AT --> AZ

    AZ --> BA{Exception raised anywhere?}
    BA -->|No| BB([End])
    BA -->|Yes| BC[Catch exception, log error, append history, return error response]
    BC --> BB
